T*
() Tj
T*
(THIS AGREEMENT made this February 28, 2025, by and between San Joaquin Heritage Farms, Inc.) Tj
T*
(\("Lessor", whether one or more\), and San Joaquin Oil Company \("Lessee"\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Granting Clause) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Lessor, in consideration of $1,100.00 per net mineral acre and the covenants herein, grants,) Tj
T*
(leases, and lets exclusively unto Lessee the land described below for the purpose of) Tj
T*
(exploring for, drilling, and producing oil and gas, together with rights of ingress and) Tj
T*
(egress.) Tj
T*
(2. Description of Leased Premises) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The leased premises are situated in Kern County, California, and described as: Township 30) Tj
T*
(South, Range 28 East, M.D.M., Section 12: NW/4, containing 160.00 acres, more or less \(the) Tj
T*
("Leased Premises"\).) Tj
T*
(3. Primary Term) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This lease shall remain in force for a primary term of three \(3\) years from the effective) Tj
T*
(date \(the "Primary Term"\) and as long thereafter as oil or gas is produced in paying) Tj
T*
(quantities from the Leased Premises or lands pooled therewith.) Tj
T*
(4. Royalty) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Lessee shall pay Lessor a royalty of one-sixth \(1/6\) of the gross proceeds of all oil and) Tj
T*
(gas produced and sold from the Leased Premises, free of costs of production but bearing its) Tj
T*
(proportionate share of post-production costs as permitted by law.) Tj
T*
(5. Shut-In Royalty) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If a well capable of producing gas is shut in, Lessee may maintain this lease by paying a) Tj
T*
(shut-in royalty of $50.00 per net mineral acre per year.) Tj
T*
(6. Pooling) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Lessee may pool the Leased Premises with other lands to form a unit not exceeding 640 acres) Tj
T*
(\(plus 10% tolerance\) for an oil well or 1,280 acres for a horizontal gas well, in conformity) Tj
T*
(with applicable spacing rules.) Tj
T*
(7. Warranty and Surrender) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Lessor warrants title to the Leased Premises. Lessee may surrender this lease, in whole or) Tj
T*
(in part, by recording a release. This lease binds the heirs, successors, and assigns of the) Tj
T*
(parties.) Tj
